# Security mode turned off from this phone (设置 › 安全 › 关闭安全模式): what that gives up said, the workspace's name
# typed to confirm it, the screen lock's PIN given for the vault's keys; then off, and the station's lock says so.
#only android
timeout 120000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
until =安全
tap =安全
until 关闭安全模式
tap 关闭安全模式
until 关闭安全模式？
shot 1-confirm
type Dev
tap =关闭安全模式
# (once: the vault's keys, taken out to the station in plain text, under the screen lock; that prompt says it turns
# security mode off, and none comes after it)
log do: android-unlock 1234
done 1-android-unlock
# (the app in front again, nothing else asked)
until 安全模式未开启
shot 2-off
